@startuml IGshorts_Instagram_Data_Flow
title IGshorts — Instagram Data Flow

skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam defaultFontColor #1F2937
skinparam roundCorner 16
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.6
skinparam ArrowFontColor #1E293B
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowFontStyle bold
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam packageBorderThickness 2
skinparam packageFontColor #0F172A
skinparam packageFontStyle bold
skinparam packageFontSize 14
skinparam rectangleBorderThickness 1.5
skinparam rectangleFontColor #1E293B
skinparam databaseBorderColor #C2410C
skinparam databaseFontColor #1E293B
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFBEB
skinparam noteBorderColor #D97706
skinparam noteFontColor #78350F
skinparam noteFontSize 12
skinparam legendBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam legendBorderColor #CBD5E1
skinparam Padding 10
skinparam nodesep 30
skinparam ranksep 28

top to bottom direction

package "1  ·  VISITOR" as Step1 #FEF3C7 {
  rectangle "**Search**\n----\nVisitor types an exact handle on IGshorts\nExample: @creatorname" as Search #FDE68A
}

package "2  ·  IGSHORTS BACKEND" as Step2 #DBEAFE {
  rectangle "**Check the saved database first**\n----\nThe server receives the username\nand looks it up before any outside call" as Check #BFDBFE
}

package "3  ·  META DEVELOPER APP" as Step3 #EDE9FE {
  rectangle "**The bridge to Meta**\n----\nRegisters IGshorts so Meta recognizes the software\nApp ID identifies the application\nApp Secret authenticates the server\nAccess token is the temporary key for each request" as App #DDD6FE
}

package "4  ·  INSTAGRAM / META API" as Step4 #DCFCE7 {
  rectangle "**Business Discovery**\n----\nOne request, one exact username\nEligible public Business or Creator account\nName, bio, profile photo, follower count" as API #BBF7D0
}

package "5  ·  IGSHORTS DATABASE" as Step5 #FFEDD5 {
  database "**Stored reading**\n----\nProfile, source, and check time\nA failed check never becomes zero" as DB #FED7AA
}

package "6  ·  IGSHORTS PROCESSING" as Step6 #ECFDF5 {
  rectangle "**Audience group**\n----\nComputed from the stored follower count\nUnder 10 thousand stays ungrouped" as Group #A7F3D0
}

package "7  ·  RESULT" as Step7 #E0F2FE {
  rectangle "**Shown to the visitor**\n----\nCreator profile, audience group,\nand the figures we actually hold" as Result #BAE6FD
}

Search -down-> Check : exact @handle

Check -down-> DB : saved reading is still current
Check -down-> App : missing, or due for a check

App -down-> API : authorized request
API -down-> DB : usable profile is saved

DB -down-> Group
Group -down-> Result

note bottom of API
  **What this access is**
  Permission to ask about one eligible account.
  Personal and private accounts come back empty.
  It is not a copy of Instagram's user database,
  and it does not build a worldwide ranking by itself.
end note

legend right
  |= Piece |= Purpose |
  | Meta Developer App | Registers IGshorts with Meta |
  | App ID | Identifies our application |
  | App Secret | Authenticates the backend |
  | Access token | Allows one authorized request. Renew about every 60 days |
  | Instagram API | Returns one eligible public professional account |
  | IGshorts database | Stores the reading, then the audience group is calculated |
endlegend

caption Meta is one permitted source. A current saved profile is shown without a new API call.

@enduml
